            "heading_name": "Introductory statement and general investigational plan",
            "subsections": [
                {
                    "subsection_id": "3.12.23(a)(3)(i)",
                    "source_text": "A brief introductory statement giving the name of the drug and all active ingredients, the drug's pharmacological class, the structural formula of the drug (if known), the formulation of the dosage form(s) to be used, the route of administration, and the broad objectives and planned duration of the proposed clinical investigation(s).",
